---
import Doc from '../components/Doc.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
const updated = '2026-10-16';
---
<Doc title="Contact The Filings Docket: Corrections and Questions" description="How to reach The Filings Docket at stockmarketnews.online by email for corrections, data questions and feedback, and what a reference site can help with."
  path="/contact/" h1="How do I contact The Filings Docket?" kicker="Contact" updated={updated} ldType="ContactPage"
  answer={`Email ${site.contactEmail}. We read every message about corrections, data problems and feedback. Please include the page address and, for a filing, its accession number, so we can check the record against EDGAR.`}>
  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>If a summary, a date or a rule description is wrong, tell us which page and what the correct information is, with a source if you have one. Confirmed errors are fixed on the page and the updated date changes.</p>
  <h2>What we cannot help with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Investment, legal or tax advice, including whether to buy or sell any security.</li>
    <li>Questions about a company's business; contact the company's investor relations office.</li>
    <li>Filing problems on EDGAR; the SEC's Filer Support handles those.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>Ads on this site are served by Google AdSense. We do not sell sponsored posts or links.</p>
  <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a></p>
</Doc>
